Package: MSEBayesDev
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Threshold Multiple-Systems Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Bernard W.", "Silverman",
    email = "bernard.silverman@stats.ox.ac.uk",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Implements Bayesian thresholding for multiple-systems estimation
    using Poisson log-linear models and Markov chain Monte Carlo. Pairwise
    interaction effects may be selected by posterior thresholding, with an
    optional hierarchical extension to three-way interactions. Both proper
    and improper priors for interaction effects are supported.
